metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 143: the Wind Spirit (Kazekun), Ricco Harbor's wisp of wind. Put it where it should live (its place; it flies, so anywhere in the air is fine). It stays invisible until Mario comes within about 13 m, then puffs into view, circles 2.7 m over his head about 10 m out for 4 s or so, tumbles in place to wind up (the READY sound), and dashes through him (its touch hurts) before vanishing in a puff; a few seconds later it comes back from its place. Spray it with water while it is out and it drops with a cry and stays away much longer. It flies through walls and floors (as the game's does). A stomp while it is out kills it (RelaunchTicks -1 = gone for good; 1800 = back in 15 s). Knobs: Deviations (SpeedScale), Effects (the appear puff, the wind streaks), Sounds (slots)."

